{"id":1749085,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-14T12:04:42.408Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749085,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Selamat Malam Tan Sri","overview":"# The Story of Hanim Hanani  This is a story about a journalist named Hanim Hanani who wants to expose the secret of Tan Sri Rahman, who is said to have two wives in secret. Tan Sri Rahman Shah manages his business as if there is no tomorrow. He works tirelessly, thinking day and night about profit and loss. It is destined that a plan published in a magazine turns his life into chaos. The journalist is being sought. Unexpectedly, Tan Sri Rahman begins to fall in love with the journalist named Hanim Hanani. Hanim Hanani's decision to choose this man is not because of his wealth. If that were the reason and accusation, she denies it. She is not chasing luxury. Nor is it out of pity. In fact, she had flatly rejected the marriage proposal of a young man. However, Hanim Hanani does not deny that wealth, status, and prestige also stirred in her heart. From the first moment she saw the man with the title of Tan Sri in her capacity as a journalist, her heart began to flutter.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/kbm8E65QpyvxVlBqidoqD7tnKN1.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2018-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Selamat Malam Tan Sri","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1275338,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Eizlan Yusof","original_name":"Eizlan Yusof","popularity":0.5723,"profile_path":"/eqS7mGlqQkHRPZjlSBWYIZKpEja.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7e7d5ef8a1f62f47e70a4d","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1289407,"known_for_department":"Acting","nam